            <ArticleTitle>Researches on Transcriptome Sequencing in the Study of Traditional Chinese Medicine.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>7521363</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1155/2017/7521363</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Due to its incomparable advantages, the application of transcriptome sequencing in the study of traditional Chinese medicine attracts more and more attention of researchers, which greatly promote the development of traditional Chinese medicine. In this paper, the applications of transcriptome sequencing in traditional Chinese medicine were summarized by reviewing recent related papers.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
